   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WHITE GOLD: Multi-Stakeholder Platform for Transformative and Coordinated Actions to Implement the White Gold Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The White Gold Initiative (WGI) is a four-year program (2024-2028) launched by the Ministry of Food and Agriculture (MOFALI) to boost the manufacturing and export of environmentally friendly, value-added wool, cashmere, and leather products. By supporting the operationalization of the WGI through a multistakeholder coordination platform, this initiative will promote policy coherence, strengthen trade and value-added exports, and support the development of innovative financing solutions to bridge</narrative>
  </description>
